<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>Gossip - 标签 - Victor's Code Journey</title><link>http://www.victorchu.info/tags/gossip/</link><description>Gossip - 标签 - Victor's Code Journey</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><managingEditor>victorchu0610@outlook.com (victorchutian)</managingEditor><webMaster>victorchu0610@outlook.com (victorchutian)</webMaster><lastBuildDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 20:09:28 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="http://www.victorchu.info/tags/gossip/" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>Gossip 协议：把消息扩散变成收敛算法</title><link>http://www.victorchu.info/posts/2026/11/30324d93/</link><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 20:09:28 +0800</pubDate><author><name>victorchutian</name></author><guid>http://www.victorchu.info/posts/2026/11/30324d93/</guid><description>&lt;div class="featured-image">
                &lt;img src="/feature-images/distribute.webp" referrerpolicy="no-referrer">
            &lt;/div>Gossip 用随机扩散换掉了中心协调：没有单点，节点挂了消息照走。本文推导 O(log N) 收敛是怎么来的，区分反熵与谣言传播两种模式，并拆解 Redis Cluster 的故障检测与 Consul/SWIM 的成员维护。</description></item><item><title>Lifeguard：让失败检测先审视自己</title><link>http://www.victorchu.info/posts/2026/11/8984d695/</link><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 20:09:28 +0800</pubDate><author><name>victorchutian</name></author><guid>http://www.victorchu.info/posts/2026/11/8984d695/</guid><description>&lt;div class="featured-image">
                &lt;img src="/feature-images/paper.webp" referrerpolicy="no-referrer">
            &lt;/div>SWIM 会把健康节点误判为故障，根因是本地消息处理太慢而非对端真的挂了。HashiCorp 的 Lifeguard 用「局部健康」让每个探测者先审视自己：误报事件总数降到基线的 1.53%，中位延迟只增加约 0.01 秒。本文是论文全文翻译。</description></item><item><title>SWIM：可扩展的弱一致感染式进程组成员协议</title><link>http://www.victorchu.info/posts/2026/11/27ee6cbd/</link><pubDate>Wed, 25 Nov 2026 20:09:28 +0800</pubDate><author><name>victorchutian</name></author><guid>http://www.victorchu.info/posts/2026/11/27ee6cbd/</guid><description>&lt;div class="featured-image">
                &lt;img src="/feature-images/paper.webp" referrerpolicy="no-referrer">
            &lt;/div>SWIM 把故障检测与成员更新传播彻底解耦，用随机点对点探测替代心跳，首次检测期望时间与每成员消息负载都与组规模无关。本文是 DSN 2002 论文全文翻译，含流行病传播推导、incarnation number 优先级规则与实验数据。</description></item></channel></rss>